WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/charging/components/charging-curve/SpeedTrendChart.tsx — a two-series monthly trend chart.
    props: sessions: ChargingSession[]  (the parent charging-curve page owns isLoading / error / freshness).
    monthlyTrend (useMemo):
      • group by month = (started_at ?? '').slice(0,7)            → "YYYY-MM"
      • powerKw = convertPowerFromSI(peak_power_w ?? 0, 'kW')     == w / 1000
      • isDcSession(s) = !!(charger_type || (peak_power_w && peak_power_w > 20_000))  → dc[] else ac[]
      • sort months asc (localeCompare); per month dcAvgKw/acAvgKw = Math.round(avg(values) * 10) / 10
    render: ChartContainer(title/subtitle/aria/export) → Recharts LineChart with two <Line> (dcAvgKw palette[0],
            acAvgKw palette[1]), <YAxis label "Avg kW">, <XAxis month>, <Tooltip ChartTooltip>; bottom legend
            "DC Fast" (cyan) / "AC / Home" (emerald). Empty handled by ChartContainer overlay when no rows.
  Data sources (prompt): useTranslation, useChartPalette.  Shared components: @/components/charts.  Maps: none.

